GOTCHA: pyright reports reportMissingImports on repo-root `scripts/` and `legibility` imports, and on cross-workspace-member imports, even when the venv and interpreter are configured CORRECTLY. The cause is extraPaths COMPLETENESS and INVOCATION CONTEXT -- not venv misconfiguration (that is the separate, already-closed task 3036 cluster; do not conflate them).

FOUR DISTINCT TRIGGERS, each documented by a stamped peer under topic `pyright-extrapaths-completeness`:
  - pyright `include` scoping leaving a path outside the analysed set;
  - a missing `--directory` invocation flag, so pyright resolves relative to the wrong root;
